-- title:
--   Definitions bundle OAIEG005 of the split of OpenAI, A finitely generated counterexample to the Eilenberg–Ganea conjecture
-- statement:
--   A definitions bundle of the split of OpenAI's proof of `OAI.EilenbergGanea.source_main`, carved from OpenAI's openai/math development (OpenAI, *A finitely generated counterexample to the Eilenberg–Ganea conjecture*, OpenAI Math Release, September 23, 2026, result family 249, [github.com/openai/math](https://github.com/openai/math) at commit adc7f12, Apache License 2.0) and ported to Lean 4.33.1 and Mathlib 0df444a. The declarations and their proofs are OpenAI's.
--
--   **Contents.** It holds 23 declarations of OpenAI's Lean: 22 definitions and 1 theorem. The definitions and types are `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.edgeLookupCodes_1`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.edgeLookupCodes_2`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.edgeLookupCodes_3`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_14`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_15`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_16`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.rankIndex`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_0`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_10`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_11`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_17`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_18`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_19`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_2`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_20`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_21`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_22`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_23`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedConnection.circleWord`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.firstSector`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.seedGoldenReal`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.seedXQuaternion`.
--
--   **Sources.** They come from these modules of lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea, lean/OAI/AlgebraicTopology, lean/OAI/GroupTheory, in whole or in part: [`Seed`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/Seed.lean), [`SeedChains`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedChains.lean), [`SeedConnection`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedConnection.lean), [`SeedContraction`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedContraction.lean), [`SeedHolonomy`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedHolonomy.lean), [`Simplicial_Chains`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/AlgebraicTopology/Simplicial/Chains.lean).
